+# Phase 2 Full Scope Report — LLM Tool/Function Calling Implementation
+
+**Date**: 2026-05-31
+**Commit**: `18a86be` (branch `main`)
+**Preceding commit**: `dcdeaf1` (SSE streaming)
+**Total delta**: +825 / -124 lines across 5 files
